# HTTP examples for module 09-hazelcast. Run them from IntelliJ IDEA / VS Code (REST Client).
# The lesson itself has no web layer. These requests talk to the Hazelcast member from compose.yaml,
# started by: ./mvnw -pl modules/09-hazelcast/lesson spring-boot:run -Dspring-boot.run.profiles=client

### Is the member ready? (REST health endpoint, enabled in compose.yaml)
GET http://localhost:5701/hazelcast/health/ready

### Cluster state, member count and more
GET http://localhost:5701/hazelcast/health
